user default off
user ulticode-ops on #5395abbbc10eead10d0664f54d48c7a158a7e6f1be8ae563cb26770c614a67cf resetkeys ~* resetchannels &* +@all
user ulticode-auth on #ffe1d06b1d33a718f926fb724a647b73d55a7fcd8ff3aea7958b3777c5524a1b resetkeys ~csrf:* ~oauth:* ~rate-limit:* ~stream:integration resetchannels &* -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting
user ulticode-admin on #48d44db27c6f3c0df316c64b17c159f892873672b7638a4f165429983ca47a88 resetkeys ~rate-limit:* ~userStats:* ~contestRanking:* ~contest:* resetchannels &* -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting
user ulticode-app on #a41485c9cc9414264d6389c271ccde0c60a6fea80bff5852ba0637c7f0aececd resetkeys ~rate-limit:* ~userStats:* ~contestRanking:* ~contest:* ~monitoring:* ~queue:* ~judge:* ~email_queue ~notification_queue resetchannels &ulticode:ws:broadcast -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting +@pubsub +info
user ulticode-submission on #8db4a19c8e12b5f58b9d876f318f989e5f18638cff67f400370e3162776fed7e resetkeys ~stream:integration ~judge:* resetchannels &* -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting
user ulticode-search on #030ac23be959f178478486de4dab9e0e688de48fd49b49709328a6c6429c0bde resetkeys ~stream:integration ~search:* resetchannels &* -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting
user ulticode-notification on #c76a40783c64ddd61a37b650de3ceca9bec1b4ae8f5e3ea88571fc3b600b59b8 resetkeys ~stream:integration ~poison:* ~notification:* resetchannels &ulticode:ws:broadcast -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting +@pubsub
user ulticode-judge on #b68e0131f67d08582484847dceea50a1a46cbd8d5db755776d50ce120f99a070 resetkeys ~judge_queue ~queue:* ~judge:* resetchannels &* -@all +@connection +@read +@write +@scripting
